  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At the giant dream realm near Yi Tian Mountain, after Duke Long clears flowers from his body, Purple Mountain True Monarch activates an immortal killer move. Dozens of purple light illusions surround him, then multiply from one into four and four into ten until they form a huge army. His true body is concealed as that purple light illusion army charges Duke Long.",
