      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "char_duke_long",
        "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long answers with dragon claws that leave several-meter claw marks in the air; wherever the marks pass, purple light illusions collapse, and the army is quickly eradicated. Mystical light from Duke Long’s dragon eyes then surrounds a secluded space and exposes Purple Mountain True Monarch’s location, forcing him to come out.",
